{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25913","headline":"赋得芙蓉出水 · 陈至","name":"赋得芙蓉出水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菡萏迎秋吐，夭摇映水滨。\n剑芒开宝匣，峰影写蒲津。\n下覆差参荇，高辞苒弱苹。\n自当巢翠甲，非止戏頳鳞。\n莫以时先後，而言色故新。\n芳香正堪翫，谁报涉江人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈至","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}